              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lakini nyinyi wengine mlioko huko Thuatira ambao hamfuati mafundisho yake Yezebeli na ambao hamkujifunza kile wanachokiita Siri ya Shetani, nawaambieni kwamba sitawapeni mzigo mwingine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
